{"id": "RT-sources-evidence-map", "body": {"t": "main", "a": {"class": "wrap", "id": "main-content"}, "c": [" ", " ", {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "kicker"}, "c": ["Public source register · 30 September 2026"]}, {"t": "h1", "c": ["What supports which claim?"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lede"}, "c": ["The source, its date and its limit belong together. A national guideline states a general recommendation; a local policy records a procedure at a point in time; an individual account reports one experience. They answer different questions."]}, " ", {"t": "article", "a": {"class": "article-body"}, "c": [" ", {"t": "h2", "c": ["Clinical and service context"]}, " ", {"t": "ul", "c": [" ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["ADHD recognition and care:"]}, " ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng87/chapter/recommendations"}, "c": ["NICE NG87 recommendations"]}, ", especially continuity of care. National guidance; it does not decide an individual prescription or determine fault in a case."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["System pathway concerns:"]}, " ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.england.nhs.uk/publication/report-of-the-independent-adhd-taskforce/"}, "c": ["NHS England, independent ADHD Taskforce report"]}, " (2025; page updated 2026). A system review and recommendations, not evidence that a particular local action was implemented."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Safe care framework:"]}, " ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.cqc.org.uk/guidance-regulation/providers/regulations-service-providers-and-managers/health-social-care-act/regulation-12"}, "c": ["CQC guidance on Regulation 12"]}, ". A provider standard, not an individual regulatory finding."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Disability threshold:"]}, " ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2010/15/section/6"}, "c": ["Equality Act 2010, section 6"]}, ". The statutory definition depends on substantial, long-term effect; a diagnosis alone does not decide every adjustment."]}, " "]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "c": ["Historical local policy copies"]}, " ", {"t": "ul", "c": [" ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/cwpt-complaints-policy-v9-1.pdf"}, "c": ["CWPT Complaints Policy v9.1"]}, " — supplied historical copy; check the trust's current route and deadlines."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/cwpt-safeguarding-adults-v5-0.pdf"}, "c": ["CWPT Safeguarding Adults Policy v5.0"]}, " — institutional policy, not a decision about any individual's threshold."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/cwpt-freedom-to-speak-up-v6-5.pdf"}, "c": ["CWPT Freedom to Speak Up Policy v6.5"]}, " — staff route, distinct from patient complaints."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/cwicb-adhd-under25-policy-v3.pdf"}, "c": ["Coventry and Warwickshire ICB ADHD under-25 policy v3"]}, " — historical commissioning copy with an age scope; do not apply it to adult care or assume it remains current."]}, " "]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "c": ["First-person record and permitted commentary"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/journey/"}, "c": ["Journey"]}, " and ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/accountability/"}, "c": ["Accountability"]}, " report a first-person chronology. Three original video files now accompany the accountability page. A clip records the speaker and date; it does not independently establish a clinical diagnosis, causation or the full institutional record."]}, " ", {"t": "ul", "c": [" ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/2026-08-24_Asherson_ADHD_Continuity.pdf"}, "c": ["Professor Asherson, 24 August 2026"]}, " and ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/2026-08-27_Asherson_risk_benefit_permission.pdf"}, "c": ["27 August extract and permission"]}, ". His comments have the limits stated on the ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/accountability/"}, "c": ["accountability page"]}, ": he was not involved in care and did not have the full clinical details."]}, " ", {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/docs/2026-09-01_Shakespeare_disability_access_permission.pdf"}, "c": ["Professor Shakespeare, 1 September 2026, extract and permission"]}, ". A view on access and accommodation, not a judicial determination."]}, " "]}, " ", {"t": "h2", "c": ["Reading the pages"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["Where an individual page reports a letter or meeting but the underlying personal record is not published, read it as the advocate's account. Private clinical letters and complaint submissions are not exposed here. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/sources/method/"}, "c": ["How the source method works"]}, " explains the distinction between source, claim, inference and proposed action."]}, " "]}, " ", " ", {"t": "aside", "a": {"class": "lib-block", "aria-labelledby": "lib-heading"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "a": {"id": "lib-heading"}, "c": ["From the library"]}, {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lib-note"}, "c": ["Dated articles, sources, visuals and downloads for this section, held in the MJB ADHD library on Google Drive and added to over time. ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/archive/"}, "c": ["How the library works"]}]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "lib-grid"}, "c": [{"t": "div", "a": {"class": "lib-repo", "id": "lib-science"}, "c": [{"t": "h3", "c": ["Confirmed Science"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Guidance and population evidence behind What ADHD is."]}, {"t": "ul", "a": {"class": "lib-links"}, "c": [{"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GcK4d3IMj-3B-GVasFssgOWtXdoReHxD", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Articles", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "visually-hidden"}, "c": [" for Confirmed Science (opens Google Drive)"]}]}]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nR2dz5cXTKB77-8p51x3KZFAbOkCRPvv", "rel": "noopener"}, "c": ["Sources", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": 